  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "After Paradise Earth’s death, Fang Yuan finds that only two heaven path Immortal Gu stood in that line of inheritance among the named pair: heavenly web Gu and heavenly birth Gu. Heavenly birth Gu was used by Paradise Earth to revive, and it was also his core Immortal Gu when converting from earth path to heaven path. Paradise Earth’s will destroyed those Immortal Gu before death.",
        "chapters": [
          2227
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_paradise_earth_immortal_venerable",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "sys_immortal_gu",
          "gu_heavenly_web_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Once heavenly web Gu is refined, Fang Yuan’s next target is heavenly birth Gu. Heavenly birth Gu can heal Immortal Gu, and with Fang Yuan’s refinement path killer moves it can affect heaven form. After obscured heavenly secret, refining heavenly birth Gu and stabilizing heaven form is his stated follow-up goal.",
        "chapters": [
          2227
        ],
